{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-0550",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "这儿离二条院很近，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This place was very close to the Nijo estate,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "天没有亮就到达，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and they arrived before daybreak,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "车子赶到西殿前停下了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the carriage hurried up to the west wing and stopped in front of it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "源氏公子轻松地抱了紫儿下车。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji lightly lifted Murasaki in his arms and got down from the carriage.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "少纳言乳母说：“我心里还像做梦一样，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Shonagon the nurse said, \"In my heart this still feels like a dream,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "怎么办呢？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "what am I to do?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "她踌躇着不下车。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She hesitated and would not get down from the carriage.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "源氏公子说：“随你便吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji said, \"Do as you please.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "姑娘本人已经来了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The young lady herself has already come here,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "你如果要回去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and if you want to go back,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "就送你回去吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will have you taken back.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "少纳言乳母没有办法，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Shonagon the nurse had no choice,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "只得下车。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and could only get down from the carriage.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "这件事太突如其来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The whole affair had come far too suddenly,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "她吃惊之下，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and in her shock,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "心头乱跳。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "her heart beat wildly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "她想：“她父亲知道了将作何感想，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She thought, \"When her father learns of this, what will he feel,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "将怎么说呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and what will he say?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "姑娘的前途怎么样呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What will become of the young lady's future?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "总而言之，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In any case,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "死了母亲和外祖母，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "having lost both her mother and her grandmother,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 22,
      "source_text": "就命苦了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "she is bound to have a hard fate.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 23,
      "source_text": "想到这里，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Thinking this far,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 24,
      "source_text": "眼泪流个不住；",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "her tears flowed without stopping;",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 25,
      "source_text": "又念今天是第一天到此，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then she remembered that today was their first day here,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 26,
      "source_text": "哭泣是不祥的，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and that weeping would be inauspicious,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00550",
      "unit_index": 27,
      "source_text": "便竭力忍耐。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so she did her utmost to endure it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
